#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:4
msgid "Extending Newton Solvers"
msgstr "扩展 Newton 求解器"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page is for contributors adding a Newton solver to Isaac Lab or "
"building a custom coupled solver. It describes the "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` extension contract: what the"
" manager owns, when its hooks run, and what a subclass must provide."
msgstr ""
"本页面向为 Isaac Lab 添加 Newton 求解器或构建自定义耦合求解器的贡献者，介绍 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` "
"的扩展约定：管理器负责哪些内容、钩子何时运行，以及子类必须提供什么。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:11
msgid ""
"If you only need to select and configure a shipped solver, use the user-"
"facing pages instead: :doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets` for "
"backend and preset selection, the :ref:`solver tuning guides <solver-"
"tuning>` for shipped solvers, and :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers` for choosing"
" a coupling approach."
msgstr ""
"如果只需选择和配置已有求解器，请使用面向使用者的页面： :doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets` "
"介绍后端和预设选择， :ref:`求解器调参指南 <solver-tuning>` 介绍随附求解器， :ref:`newton-coupled-"
"solvers` 介绍耦合方式的选择。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:18
msgid "When a Solver Manager Is Needed"
msgstr "何时需要求解器管理器"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:20
msgid ""
"Each Newton solver is exposed as a "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` subclass. Write a new one "
"when:"
msgstr ""
"每个 Newton 求解器都通过 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` "
"子类提供。以下情况需要编写新管理器："

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:23
msgid "a Newton solver has no Isaac Lab manager yet;"
msgstr "Newton 求解器尚无 Isaac Lab 管理器；"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:24
msgid ""
"the solver needs its own contact allocation, builder attributes, or reset "
"handling;"
msgstr "求解器需要自己的接触分配、构建器属性或重置处理；"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:26
msgid ""
"several solvers must advance one shared model and the substep order is part "
"of the algorithm."
msgstr "多个求解器必须推进同一共享模型，且子步顺序属于算法的一部分。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:29
msgid ""
"Do not write one when an existing solver can advance the whole model, or "
"when the scene can be partitioned into named solver entries. Partitioning is"
" already covered by :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` and "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg`, which "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.NewtonCouplerManager` resolves into entry"
" views over a shared model. Prefer that path for mixed rigid and deformable "
"scenes. Write a coupled manager only when contact detection is shared but "
"each solver consumes the contacts differently, or when the exchange between "
"solvers is a custom force, impulse, or state transfer."
msgstr ""
"如果现有求解器能够推进整个模型，或场景可划分为命名求解器条目，就不必新建管理器。 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg` 已支持这种划分， "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.NewtonCouplerManager` "
"将它们解析为共享模型上的条目视图。刚体与可变形物体混合场景应优先使用此路径。只有共享接触检测、但各求解器以不同方式使用接触，或求解器间需要自定义力、冲量或状态传递时，才编写耦合管理器。"

