msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` is a class-level singleton: "
"all state lives on the base class and there are no instance methods, so "
"exactly one manager subclass is active per simulation."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` "
"是类级单例：所有状态保存在基类上，没有实例方法，因此每个仿真中恰好只有一个管理器子类处于启用状态。"

