#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:125
msgid ""
"``_build_solver()`` runs after the model is finalized, so it may size solver"
" resources from the real model. ``_register_builder_attributes()`` runs "
"before particles are added and before ``finalize()``, so it is the only "
"place to register Newton custom attributes."
msgstr ""
"``_build_solver()`` 在模型完成构建后运行，因此可根据实际模型确定求解器资源大小。 "
"``_register_builder_attributes()`` 在添加粒子和 ``finalize()`` 之前运行，是唯一可注册 Newton "
"自定义属性的位置。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:130
msgid ""
"``step()`` takes one of two paths, selected by "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.handles_decimation`. When "
"every actuator is on the graph-safe Newton fast path, actuators and substeps"
" run together inside one graph and ``step()`` runs the whole decimation "
"loop, so ``_step_solver()`` runs ``decimation x num_substeps`` times per "
"call. Otherwise actuators run eagerly, only the substeps are graphed through"
" ``_simulate_physics_only()``, and the environment drives decimation by "
"calling ``step()`` repeatedly. Both paths reach ``_step_solver()`` through "
"the same substep loop."
msgstr ""
"``step()`` 根据 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.handles_decimation` "
"选择两条路径之一。所有执行器都使用支持图捕获的 Newton 快速路径时，执行器与子步在同一个图中运行， ``step()`` "
"执行完整控制降采样循环，因此每次调用运行 ``decimation x num_substeps`` 次 ``_step_solver()`` "
"。否则，执行器即时运行，只有子步通过 ``_simulate_physics_only()`` 捕获为图，环境通过重复调用 ``step()`` "
"实现控制降采样。两条路径都通过同一子步循环调用 ``_step_solver()`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:140
msgid ""
"Graph capture happens at one of several points. ``initialize_solver()`` "
"captures unless the graph-safe path is active; in that case "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.set_decimation` captures once "
"the decimation is known, and the RTX path defers capture to the first "
"``step()``. All routes check ``_supports_cuda_graph_capture()``. The non-RTX"
" route additionally checks "
"``_requires_initial_reset_before_graph_capture()``."
msgstr ""
"图捕获可能在多个时机发生。通常由 ``initialize_solver()`` 捕获；启用支持图捕获的快速路径时， "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.set_decimation` "
"在控制降采样倍数确定后捕获，RTX 路径则延迟到首次 ``step()`` 。所有路径都会检查 "
"``_supports_cuda_graph_capture()`` ，非 RTX 路径还检查 "
"``_requires_initial_reset_before_graph_capture()`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:149
msgid ""
"With ``_use_single_state = False`` the base manager ping-pongs "
"``NewtonManager._state_0`` and ``NewtonManager._state_1`` after each "
"substep, except on the final substep of an odd count, where it copies "
"instead. Never cache a ``State`` reference in ``_build_solver()``; read the "
"current state through the class attribute on each use."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``_use_single_state = False`` 时，基类管理器在每个子步后交换 ``NewtonManager._state_0`` "
"和 ``NewtonManager._state_1`` ；子步数为奇数时，最后一个子步改为拷贝。不要在 ``_build_solver()`` 中缓存"
" ``State`` 引用；每次使用时，通过类属性读取当前状态。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:157
msgid "Extension Contract"
msgstr "扩展约定"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:159
msgid ""
"A subclass must implement ``_build_solver()`` and assign four slots on "
"``NewtonManager`` itself, not on ``cls``. "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.initialize_solver` raises "
"``RuntimeError`` if ``_solver`` is still unset. The other three are not "
"validated and keep their defaults, so a subclass that forgets them runs with"
" double-buffered states, no collision pipeline, and no visualizer force "
"input."
msgstr ""
"子类必须实现 ``_build_solver()`` ，并为 ``NewtonManager`` 本身而非 ``cls`` 上的四个槽位赋值。如果 "
"``_solver`` 仍未设置， "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.initialize_solver` 会抛出 "
"``RuntimeError`` 。其他三个槽位不验证，保留默认值，因此遗漏它们的子类会使用双缓冲状态运行，没有碰撞流程，也不接收可视化器施加的力。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:170
