#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:219
msgid ""
"``_prepare_builder_for_finalize()``: normalize imported or replicated "
"builder data immediately before ``finalize()``."
msgstr ""
"``_prepare_builder_for_finalize()`` ：在 ``finalize()`` 前规范化导入或复制的构建器数据。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:221
msgid ""
"``_supports_cuda_graph_capture()``: return ``False`` to fall back to eager "
"execution."
msgstr "``_supports_cuda_graph_capture()`` ：返回 ``False`` ，回退到即时执行。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:223
msgid ""
"``_requires_initial_reset_before_graph_capture()``: delay headless capture "
"until the first post-reset step."
msgstr ""
"``_requires_initial_reset_before_graph_capture()`` ：将无界面图捕获延迟到重置后的第一步。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:225
msgid ""
"``_solver_specific_clear()``: release class-level state the subclass owns."
msgstr "``_solver_specific_clear()`` ：释放子类负责的类级状态。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:226
msgid ""
"``_check_solver_status()`` and ``_log_solver_debug()``: run after stepping."
msgstr "``_check_solver_status()`` 和 ``_log_solver_debug()`` ：在步进后运行。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:228
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager` overrides both builder "
"hooks."
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager` 覆盖了两个构建器钩子。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:230
msgid ""
"Raise from ``_build_solver()`` on an unsupported configuration rather than "
"silently degrading. Name the manager ``Newton<Solver>Manager``."
msgstr ""
"配置不受支持时，应在 ``_build_solver()`` 中抛出异常，而不是静默降级。管理器应命名为 "
"``Newton<Solver>Manager`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:235
msgid "Coupling Paths"
msgstr "耦合路径"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:237
msgid "The four architectures differ in what drives the substep loop:"
msgstr "四种架构的区别在于由谁驱动子步循环："

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:243
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:244
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "结构"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:245
msgid "Standalone solver"
msgstr "独立求解器"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:246
msgid ""
"One manager subclass, one solver, one model. The base class owns the substep"
" loop."
msgstr "一个管理器子类、一个求解器、一个模型。基类负责子步循环。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:248
msgid "Proxy coupling"
msgstr "代理耦合"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:249
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` partitions the model "
"into named entries. :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.NewtonCouplerManager`"
" builds a Newton coupled solver that exposes source bodies to the "
"destination solver as proxies and returns lagged feedback. No new manager is"
" required."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` 将模型划分为命名条目。 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.NewtonCouplerManager` 构建 Newton "
"耦合求解器，将源刚体作为代理提供给目标求解器，并返回滞后反馈。无需新管理器。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:254
msgid "ADMM coupling"
msgstr "ADMM 耦合"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:255
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg` uses the same manager and"
" entry model, but Newton creates symmetric interface constraints and "
"iterates the sub-solvers. No new manager is required."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg` 使用相同管理器和条目模型，但 Newton "
"创建对称接口约束，并迭代各子求解器。无需新管理器。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:258
msgid "Custom shared-model manager"
msgstr "自定义共享模型管理器"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:259
msgid ""
"A subclass constructs several sub-solvers itself and overrides "
"``_step_solver()`` to fix the substep order. "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.custom_coupling.newton_manager_cfg.CoupledMJWarpVBDSolverCfg`"
" is the in-tree example. Its manager clears force accumulators, detects "
"contacts once, injects soft-to-rigid reactions into ``body_f`` when "
"``coupling_mode=\"two_way\"``, then advances MJWarp on its own internal "
"contacts and VBD on the detected ones."
msgstr ""
"子类自行构造多个子求解器，并覆盖 ``_step_solver()`` 固定子步顺序。仓库内的示例是 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.custom_coupling.newton_manager_cfg.CoupledMJWarpVBDSolverCfg`"
" 。其管理器清除力累加器，只检测一次接触，在 ``coupling_mode=\"two_way\"`` 时将软体对刚体的反作用力注入 "
"``body_f`` ，随后让 MJWarp 使用自身内部接触、VBD 使用已检测接触分别步进。"

#: source/developer-tools/extending_newton_solvers.rst:267
msgid ""
"A custom shared-model manager bypasses entry ownership resolution, so it "
"cannot reuse the coupler's selectors or validation. For the proxy and ADMM "
"trade-offs, see :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers`."
msgstr ""
"自定义共享模型管理器绕过条目归属解析，因此不能复用耦合器的选择器或验证。代理与 ADMM 的取舍见 :ref:`newton-coupled-"
"solvers` 。"

